n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Qualification:** \n\n\n\n* Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or related field, or equivalent practical experience.\n* 4\\-6 years of IT support or system administration experience.\n* Strong knowledge of macOS and Windows environments.\n* Hands\\-on experience with tools such as Google Workspace, Okta, Slack, MDM (Kandji), EDR (SentinelOne).\n* Familiarity with asset management, IT procurement, and lifecycle management.\n* Strong troubleshooting, communication, and documentation skills.\n* Security\\-first mindset with experience handling security alerts and vulnerabilities.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Nice to Have:** \n\n\n\n* Industry certifications such as CompTIA A\\+, Network\\+, Security\\+, or equivalent.\n* Experience with PAM solutions, system vulnerability management tools, or advanced networking.\n* Prior experience in a fast\\-paced startup environment.\n* Ability to conduct IT training sessions and employee security awareness programs."},{"title":"Assistant Professor Of Political Science","company":"Kumaraguru College Of Liberal Arts And Science","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-03","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/assistant-professor-of-political-science-job-in-coimbatore-at-kumaraguru-college-of-liberal-arts-and-science1788395481","experience":"3 year(s)"},{"title":"[NWUDBAA2] Linux Administrator","company":"ZettaMine Labs Private Limited","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-04","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/nwudbaa2-linux-administrator-job-in-coimbatore-at-zettamine-labs-private-limited1788481893","experience":"5 year(s)"},{"title":"Igcse  ( Grades 9/10 ) Physics Teacher","company":"Yellow Train School","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-04","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-igcse--grades-9-10--physics-teacher-job-in-coimbatore-at-yellow-train-school1788481880"},{"title":"Junior Architect","company":"Octa Orient","location":"Coimba